text Naranja_PuebloPaleta_G26_M05_Text_08199F2C {
    "Welcome to the BATTLE TOWER!\pPlease register with me to enter\na BATTLE ROOM."
}

text Naranja_PuebloPaleta_G26_M05_Text_08199F79 {
    "Would you like to make a BATTLE ROOM\nchallenge?"
}

text Naranja_PuebloPaleta_G26_M05_Text_08199FA9 {
    "We’ll be looking forward to your\nnext challenge."
}

text Naranja_PuebloPaleta_G26_M05_Text_08199FDA {
    "Before entering a BATTLE ROOM, your\nprogress must be saved. Is that okay?"
}

text Naranja_PuebloPaleta_G26_M05_Text_0819A024 {
    "There are two BATTLE ROOMS,\nLevel 50 and Level 100.\lWhich would you like to challenge?"
}

text Naranja_PuebloPaleta_G26_M05_Text_0819A07B {
    "Please select the POKéMON you wish\nto enter."
}

text Naranja_PuebloPaleta_G26_M05_Text_0819A0A8 {
    "I’ll direct you to your BATTLE ROOM now."
}

text Naranja_PuebloPaleta_G26_M05_Text_0819A0D1 {
    "The BATTLE TOWER is a facility made\nespecially for POKéMON battles.\pWithin the TOWER are many BATTLE ROOMS.\pIn each BATTLE ROOM, seven TRAINERS\nawait your challenge.\pBeat all seven, and you will be rewarded\nwith a fabulous prize.\pYou may also take a break from your\nchallenge by saving your progress.\pMake sure you save properly or you\nwon’t be able to resume your challenge."
}

text Naranja_PuebloPaleta_G26_M05_Text_0819A249 {
    "Excuse me!\pYou don’t have three eligible POKéMON.\pYou must have three different POKéMON\nof Level 50 or less to enter.\pThey also must be holding different\nkinds of items.\pEGGS{STR_VAR_1} ineligible.\pPlease come see me when you are ready."
}

text Naranja_PuebloPaleta_G26_M05_Text_0819A32D {
    "Excuse me!\pYou don’t have three eligible POKéMON.\pYou must have three different POKéMON\nto enter.\pThey also must be holding different\nkinds of items.\pEGGS{STR_VAR_1} ineligible.\pPlease come see me when you are ready."
}

text Naranja_PuebloPaleta_G26_M05_Text_0819A3FD {
    "Excuse me!\pYou didn’t save before you quit your\nchallenge last time.\pBecause of that, your challenge so far\nhas been disqualified. Sorry!"
}

text Naranja_PuebloPaleta_G26_M05_Text_0819A487 {
    "Congratulations!\nYou’ve beaten all seven TRAINERS!\p"
}

text Naranja_PuebloPaleta_G26_M05_Text_0819A4BB {
    "For beating seven TRAINERS in a row,\nyou have earned this fabulous prize!\p"
}

text Naranja_PuebloPaleta_G26_M05_Text_0819A506 {
    "{PLAYER} received the prize\n{STR_VAR_1}."
}

text Naranja_PuebloPaleta_G26_M05_Text_0819A520 {
    "Oh, your BAG appears to be full.\pPlease make room in your BAG, then come\nsee me."
}

text Naranja_PuebloPaleta_G26_M05_Text_0819A571 {
    "Thank you for playing!\p"
}

text Naranja_PuebloPaleta_G26_M05_Text_0819A589 {
    "Your record will be saved.\nPlease wait."
}

text Naranja_PuebloPaleta_G26_M05_Text_0819A5B1 {
    "We’ve been waiting for you!\p"
}

text Naranja_PuebloPaleta_G26_M05_Text_0819A5CE {
    "Before entering a BATTLE ROOM, your\nprogress will be saved. Please wait."
}

text Naranja_PuebloPaleta_G26_M05_Text_0819A617 {
    "You’re finally about to face the\n50th TRAINER.\pFrom here on, every time you beat seven\nTRAINERS in a row, your POKéMON will\lreceive a commemorative RIBBON.\pGood luck!"
}

text Naranja_PuebloPaleta_G26_M05_Text_0819A6BE {
    "Here are some RIBBONS for beating\nseven tough TRAINERS in a row.\p{PLAYER} received some RIBBONS!"
}

text Naranja_PuebloPaleta_G26_M05_Text_0819A719 {
    "{PLAYER} put the RIBBONS on the\nchallenger POKéMON."
}

text Naranja_PuebloPaleta_G26_M05_Text_0819A747 {
    "Hello, hello!\nYou’re going to battle here, right?\pCan you tell me what’s going through\nyour mind as you prepare for battle?"
}

text Naranja_PuebloPaleta_G26_M05_Text_0819A7C3 {
    "Oh, wow, you’ll tell me?\nGreat! Then, what’s your answer?"
}

text Naranja_PuebloPaleta_G26_M05_Text_0819A7FD {
    "Oh, so you don’t think much about it?\nYou’re one cool customer."
}

text Naranja_PuebloPaleta_G26_M05_Text_0819A83D {
    "Hunh? You changed your mind?\nI guess you’re fickle."
}

text Naranja_PuebloPaleta_G26_M05_Text_0819A871 {
    "Okay, so that’s how you feel?\nThat’s quite original.\pThanks!"
}

text Naranja_PuebloPaleta_G26_M05_Text_0819A8AE {
    "The number of matches you win in a row\nis recorded.\pThe record is posted beside the\nregistration counter.\pIt’s also on the back of your\nTRAINER’S CARD."
}

text Naranja_PuebloPaleta_G26_M05_Text_0819A946 {
    "Once you’ve entered the BATTLE TOWER,\nyou can’t leave until you either lose\lor you beat seven TRAINERS in a row.\pYou’d best be certain that you’re up\nto the challenge."
}

text Naranja_PuebloPaleta_G26_M05_Text_0819A9EE {
    "Hahahaha! Pure magnificence!\nPure magnificence indeed!\pDo you realize what you’ve achieved?\nYou’ve beaten 50 TRAINERS in a row!\pYes, purely magnificent!\pAs the OWNER of the BATTLE TOWER,\nlet me give you a memento!"
}

text Naranja_PuebloPaleta_G26_M05_Text_0819AAC4 {
    "Wahahaha! Pure magnificence!\nAbsolutely pure magnificence indeed!\pDo you realize what you’ve achieved?\nYou’ve beaten 100 TRAINERS in a row!\pYes, absolutely magnificent!\pAs the OWNER of the BATTLE TOWER,\nlet me give you a memento!"
}

text Naranja_PuebloPaleta_G26_M05_Text_0819ABAA {
    "I suggest you keep it displayed.\nIt will surely attract attention."
}

text Naranja_PuebloPaleta_G26_M05_Text_0819ABED {
    "Oh?\nYour PC has no room for this...\pBut it would be a shame to waste this...\nPlease come back for this!"
}

text Naranja_PuebloPaleta_G26_M05_Text_0819AC55 {
    "I’m overwhelmed with satisfaction after\nseeing your magnificent performance.\pIt makes the building of the BATTLE\nTOWER all worthwhile!"
}

text Naranja_PuebloPaleta_G26_M05_Text_081A776D {
    "Hello! You’re the TRAINER who just had\na battle, right?\pI’m gathering interviews with TRAINERS\nall over the place.\pMay I get a few words from you about\nyour impressions on battling?"
}

text Naranja_PuebloPaleta_G26_M05_Text_081A7823 {
    "You will? Really?\nThank you!\lThen, uh...\pHow did things turn out in the BATTLE\nTOWER today?\pWere you satisfied with the battle?\nOr are you unhappy?"
}

text Naranja_PuebloPaleta_G26_M05_Text_081A78B7 {
    "Oh...\nSorry we disturbed you.\pPlease give us an interview the next\ntime you visit the BATTLE TOWER."
}

text Naranja_PuebloPaleta_G26_M05_Text_081A791B {
    "Well, of course!\pThat unmistakable look of satisfaction\non your face...\pIt’s obvious that you’ve had a great\nbattle."
}

text Naranja_PuebloPaleta_G26_M05_Text_081A7990 {
    "Oh, I see...\pWell, it certainly is difficult to make a\nbattle turn out exactly as planned."
}

text Naranja_PuebloPaleta_G26_M05_Text_081A79EB {
    "Oh, oh, may I ask one more question?\pIf you were to describe your\nimpressions about this battle with one\lsaying, what would it be?"
}

text Naranja_PuebloPaleta_G26_M05_Text_081A7A6E {
    "Oh, that is stunningly cool!\pThat’s a great line!\nI hope you’ll do great next time, too.\pI hope to see you again!"
}

text Naranja_PuebloPaleta_G26_M05_Text_081A7AE0 {
    "Oh, I see...\pStill, being the silent type is also cool,\nisn’t it?\pI hope you’ll give me the opportunity to\nshare your thoughts again!"
}

text Naranja_PuebloPaleta_G26_M05_Text_081A7B66 {
    "I’ll be looking forward to your next\nbattle!"
}
